{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 1.6239999999999999, "t": "Your dog knows what you're hiding.", "k": ["hiding."], "w": [0.056, 0.292, 0.482, 0.763, 0.999, 1.28]}, {"a": 1.6239999999999999, "b": 2.87, "t": "Even when you act normal.", "k": ["normal."], "w": [1.674, 1.91, 2.145, 2.336, 2.526]}, {"a": 2.87, "b": 5.396, "t": "But a study found something nobody tells you.", "k": ["something"], "w": [2.92, 3.11, 3.21, 3.491, 3.772, 4.234, 4.561, 4.842]}, {"a": 5.396, "b": 7.096, "t": "You can smile and say you're fine.", "k": ["you're"], "w": [5.446, 5.615, 5.784, 6.033, 6.202, 6.371, 6.621]}, {"a": 7.096, "b": 11.085999999999999, "t": "But in 2022, scientists in Belfast put four dogs to a test.", "k": ["2022,"], "w": [7.146, 7.365, 7.532, 8.305, 8.89, 9.057, 9.486, 9.705, 9.977, 10.248, 10.415, 10.53]}, {"a": 11.085999999999999, "b": 13.908, "t": "They took breath and sweat from 36 people, twice.", "k": ["36"], "w": [11.136, 11.389, 11.642, 11.992, 12.197, 12.498, 12.751, 13.16, 13.583]}, {"a": 13.908, "b": 17.506, "t": "Once calm, and minutes later, right after a stressful math test.", "k": ["minutes"], "w": [13.958, 14.211, 14.537, 14.741, 15.14, 15.515, 15.816, 16.118, 16.225, 16.721, 16.974]}, {"a": 17.506, "b": 20.62, "t": "They only kept people whose heart rate and blood pressure went up.", "k": ["pressure"], "w": [17.556, 17.788, 18.019, 18.251, 18.572, 18.848, 19.124, 19.356, 19.543, 19.819, 20.229, 20.461]}, {"a": 20.62, "b": 23.706, "t": "So the only difference between the two samples was stress.", "k": ["difference"], "w": [20.67, 20.813, 21.0, 21.231, 21.73, 22.096, 22.283, 22.47, 22.835, 23.022]}, {"a": 23.706, "b": 25.826, "t": "Now the part nobody tells you about.", "k": ["nobody"], "w": [23.756, 23.948, 24.139, 24.376, 24.705, 24.987, 25.179]}, {"a": 25.826, "b": 27.508, "t": "The dogs never saw those people.", "k": ["people."], "w": [25.876, 26.08, 26.332, 26.632, 26.836, 27.137]}, {"a": 27.508, "b": 29.146, "t": "They only got the samples.", "k": ["samples."], "w": [27.558, 27.81, 28.062, 28.266, 28.47]}, {"a": 29.146, "b": 32.556000000000004, "t": "And they picked the stressed one almost 94 percent of the time.", "k": ["94"], "w": [29.196, 29.38, 29.607, 29.922, 30.106, 30.508, 30.692, 31.007, 31.374, 31.733, 31.873, 32.057]}, {"a": 32.556000000000004, "b": 36.415000000000006, "t": "When you get stressed, your body releases hormones like adrenaline and cortisol.", "k": ["adrenaline"], "w": [32.606, 32.844, 33.036, 33.228, 33.717, 33.955, 34.192, 34.613, 35.034, 35.271, 35.783, 35.975]}, {"a": 36.415000000000006, "b": 38.943000000000005, "t": "That changes the chemicals in your breath and sweat,", "k": ["chemicals"], "w": [36.465, 36.702, 37.077, 37.269, 37.736, 37.882, 38.12, 38.449, 38.641]}, {"a": 38.943000000000005, "b": 40.575, "t": "and gives you a particular smell.", "k": ["particular"], "w": [38.993, 39.185, 39.468, 39.66, 39.761, 40.273]}, {"a": 40.575, "b": 42.326, "t": "That's what your dog can smell.", "k": ["That's"], "w": [40.625, 40.908, 41.146, 41.384, 41.576, 41.768]}, {"a": 42.326, "b": 44.896, "t": "You can hide it from people, but not from your dog.", "k": ["people,"], "w": [42.376, 42.545, 42.714, 42.924, 43.053, 43.262, 43.613, 43.782, 43.951, 44.161, 44.37]}, {"a": 44.896, "b": 47.053000000000004, "t": "Tell me if your dog notices your bad days.", "k": ["notices"], "w": [44.946, 45.194, 45.346, 45.498, 45.746, 45.946, 46.336, 46.584, 46.784]}, {"a": 47.053000000000004, "b": 50.010000000000005, "t": "Follow to decode your dog.", "k": ["Follow"], "w": [47.103, 47.446, 47.598, 47.941, 48.189]}], "T": {"fin": 50.06, "s_fin": 50.06, "x_hiding": 0.763, "x_even": 1.674, "x_but": 2.92, "x_nobody": 4.234, "x_fine": 6.202, "x_four": 9.705, "x_test": 10.43, "x_twice": 13.583, "x_calm": 13.958, "x_min": 14.741, "x_math": 16.721, "x_kept": 18.019, "x_heart": 18.848, "x_blood": 19.543, "x_up": 20.229, "x_so": 20.67, "x_never": 26.332, "x_only7": 27.81, "x_samples": 28.47, "x_picked": 29.607, "x_body": 33.717, "x_that": 36.465, "x_gives": 39.185, "x_part": 39.761, "x_thats": 40.625, "x_butnot": 43.613, "x_tell": 44.826, "s_cta": 47.103, "c02": 5.326, "c03": 7.026, "c04a": 11.016, "c04b": 15.475000000000001, "c05": 17.436, "c06": 23.636, "c07a": 29.076, "c07b": 30.662, "c08": 32.486000000000004, "c09": 42.256}, "marca": "THE DOGS DECODER", "tema": "mascotas", "escenas": [{"tipo": "pelicula", "desde": "0", "luz": false, "p27_fija": true, "escala": 1.24, "zoom": [{"k": -1, "s": 1.0, "dur": 0.01, "y": 1200}], "zonas": [{"x0": 100000, "x1": 101300, "cam": 100000, "set": "dc_dogs14_p01", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p01", "transicion": "inicio", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "gancho: la sonrisa en el espejo y la nariz del perro"}, {"x0": 102600, "x1": 103900, "cam": 102600, "set": "dc_dogs14_p02", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p02", "transicion": "corte", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "corte por la mirada del perro: la sonrisa de cerca", "k": "c02"}, {"x0": 105200, "x1": 106500, "cam": 105200, "set": "dc_dogs14_p03", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p03", "transicion": "corte", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "cuatro perros frente a la trampilla cerrada", "k": "c03"}, {"x0": 107800, "x1": 109100, "cam": 107800, "set": "dc_dogs14_p04a", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p04a", "transicion": "corte", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "interior, vista cenital: la muestra tranquila", "k": "c04a"}, {"x0": 110400, "x1": 111700, "cam": 110400, "set": "dc_dogs14_p04b", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p04b", "transicion": "corte", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "corte por coincidencia: el mismo gesto, minutos después", "k": "c04b"}, {"x0": 113000, "x1": 114300, "cam": 113000, "set": "dc_dogs14_p05", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_p05", "transicion": "corte", "camara": "fija", "acabado": "ninguno", "razon": "las muestras en pares sobre la tira de medición", "k": "c05"}, {"x0": 115600, "x1": 116900, "cam": 115600, "set": "dc_dogs14_p06", "entorno": "dc_dogs14_